Relations between [[Geno]] and [[Qym]] have been historically tense and hostile. The two countries have no formal diplomatic relations. Under [[Qymish government sanctions]], Qymish citizens are prohibited from entering [[Geno]] and Genonian citizens are prohibited from entering Qym, while Qym has fully sanctioned Geno since the 24th century. The source of the hostilities dates back to the [[Transhumanist Revolution]] and the establishment of the [[Geno|Transhumanist Republic of Geno]], which resulted in various human rights abuses and the establishment of [[wikipedia:chemical weapon|chemical]] and [[wikipedia:biological agent|biological weapon]] programs. While Geno has made overtures to de-escalate tensions over the last century, Qym has rejected any contact and officially considers Geno a [[wikipedia:pariah state|pariah state]] and an "[[enemy of humanity]]". 

